_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/bab47dcb3f91249174dd291d3278abec.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/bab47dcb3f91249174dd291d3278abec.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/bab47dcb3f91249174dd291d3278abec.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/20549e01167c6e7d216846390d792214.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/20549e01167c6e7d216846390d792214.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/20549e01167c6e7d216846390d792214.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ba4ae391f3049ed1e13ad9ce5c82831b.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ba4ae391f3049ed1e13ad9ce5c82831b.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ba4ae391f3049ed1e13ad9ce5c82831b.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A <i>fin-tastic</i> world awaits! </h2>Explore colorful locations, meet loveable characters and discover intriguing secrets on your journey through the insides of the whale!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b11208edc9180a046481cb5bef39bf61.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b11208edc9180a046481cb5bef39bf61.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b11208edc9180a046481cb5bef39bf61.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/9687227ce09d18f75f8a051a86a48954.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/9687227ce09d18f75f8a051a86a48954.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/9687227ce09d18f75f8a051a86a48954.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Ernest Hemingwhale</strong><br>Ernest is the hero of our story. Despite his clumsiness, he gives his best to help Fin, his home and friend<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/be8a841902153a485e134542494447cd.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/be8a841902153a485e134542494447cd.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/be8a841902153a485e134542494447cd.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Fin the whale</strong><br>Fin, the mechanical home of Ernest. Using a phonebook and charismatic profile pictures, the two can even chat. An important tool for Fin to help express the worries about his inner whale-being.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2172b9aa247dc0ce7c2253dc4da1fc59.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2172b9aa247dc0ce7c2253dc4da1fc59.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2172b9aa247dc0ce7c2253dc4da1fc59.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Squiddies</strong><br>Slimy guests that suddenly appeared inside Fin and started making mischief. Some of them even specialize in being a nuisance to Ernest.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/c0e17583932943b90e4a42cb0fe2d57d.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/c0e17583932943b90e4a42cb0fe2d57d.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/c0e17583932943b90e4a42cb0fe2d57d.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Springpeople</strong><br>Even more guests? Unlike the Squiddies though, they seem to be quite helpful. What might those springy fellows be up to?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/fdcec73b2fe5b7af9d82b490ed5c4f61.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/fdcec73b2fe5b7af9d82b490ed5c4f61.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/fdcec73b2fe5b7af9d82b490ed5c4f61.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ddbedf809de8c1fafbe538b5318e6544.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ddbedf809de8c1fafbe538b5318e6544.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ddbedf809de8c1fafbe538b5318e6544.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
